# Three one-call-site abstractions in misc/gnopreview/main.go, removed: envOr
# (cmp.Or does it), fileBudget (inlined at its only call site), and startGnodev's
# root/port parameters (already fields of the cfg it is handed).
#
# From a plain clone:
#
#   git clone https://github.com/gnolang/gno && cd gno
#   git fetch origin pull/6194/head && git checkout ecf7af0f29abe4737a52803d672bc5a33c17cc60
#   git apply <this file>
#   cd misc/gnopreview && gofmt -l . && go vet ./... && go test ./...
#
# Observed at ecf7af0f2 with go1.25.9: gofmt silent, vet silent,
# 'ok  github.com/gnolang/gno/misc/gnopreview  0.024s', main.go 339 -> 328 lines.

